## Placeholder for the site-specific version control
## SRC_TAG follows the remote-tracking branch of the source: the source update step fetches
## origin and checks out its tip. A bare branch name would keep an outdated local branch.
## A release that must build one fixed source sets a commit hash here instead.
#SRC_TAG:=61e1b4c5c819fc2473b27e2046cbab80fecc558c
SRC_TAG:=origin/modernize
#
## Only ARCHAPPL_VERSION reads SRC_VERSION, and no file reads that; a site value has no effect.
SRC_VERSION:=$(SRC_TAG)
#SRC_VERSION:=${SRC_TAG}-2022-08-08

